equipped.description:
The crown is crushed by wear into a hundred papery creases, and the brim is stained in the fractal signatures of sweat and salt.

{{cyan|Painted: This item is painted with a scene from the life of the ancient sultan {{magenta|Orohim}}:

Deep in the Window Makers' District of Narsiwar, Orohim discovered Navah. There he befriended robots and found a new home.}}

{{rules|+50 reputation with the Burgundy Sorrow of Daarramrod Brood}}

{{K|Weight: 1 lbs.}}

Wrought iron was moulded to a crescent for scything the rough hides of watervine.

{{rules|Strength Bonus Cap: 2
Weapon Class: Axe (cleaves armor on critical hit)}}

{{K|Weight: 5 lbs.}}

